Dear vmg,

The normalization is actually done indirectly in the Gaussian distribution
 q <- (qnorm(seq(0, 1, 1/alphabet_size))) * sd(x) +
                mean(x)

I put in cc Laurent Lellouch (the author of the function) just in case he'd like to confirm.

HTH

Jerome

